players, I don't know what it's going to be.

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:54.240
But what I do know is if I don't do anything
nothing's going to happen.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:58.600
And so by following my passion and by waking
up early and setting that alarm clock and

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:04.020
getting excited about something, we'll explore,
we'll try, we'll fail, we'll make mistakes

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:06.579
and we'll get better and we'll find our path.

00:17:06.579 --> 00:17:07.789
And you need to do the same thing, too.

00:17:07.789 --> 00:17:12.260
If there's something that you are excited
about, something that you want to try, then

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.260
start.

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.470
Start, even if it doesn't make any sense.

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:20.850
